& Caching Notes\r\n382: \r\n383: 1. **Zero-Token Structured Parsing**: All CSVs (`user_identities.csv`, `user_audit_log.csv`, `system_activity.csv`, `deletion_rules.csv`, `evidence_files.csv`), JSON files, plain-text logs, and SQLite `.sql` snapshot exports were parsed deterministically in SQLite/Python without LLM calls.\r\n384: 2. **`EvidenceVault` Fingerprinting**: Unstructured PDFs and images in `dataset/evidence/` were hashed and extracted once in batches rather than re-queried per `case_id`.\r\n385: 3. **Batched `request_text` Intent Classification**: Ambiguous deletion requests were grouped into multi-row JSON batches (50 requests/call) to minimize system-prompt overhead.\r\n386: \"\"\"\r\n387:         output_path.write_text(report, encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n388:         return report\r\n389: \r\n390: \r\n391: # ============================================================================\r\n392: # 3. SQLITE INGESTION & ZERO-TOKEN LOCAL INDEXING\r\n393: # ============================================================================\r\n394: \r\n395: def init_database(\r\n396:     dataset_dir: Path = Path(\"dataset\"),\r\n397:     db_path: Path = Path(\"cache/northstar.db\"),\r\n398: ) -> sqlite3.Connection:\r\n399:     \"\"\"Load participant-facing CSV data and SQL evidence into a local database.\"\"\"\r\n400:     db_path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\r\n401:     conn = sqlite3.connect(db_path)\r\n402: \r\n403:     table_columns: Dict[str, Tuple[str, ...]] = {\r\n404:         \"user_identities\": (\r\n405:             \"user_id\", \"name\", \"email\", \"phone\", \"email_hash\", \"updated_at\",\r\n406:         ),\r\n407:         \"user_audit_log\": (\r\n408:             \"audit_id\", \"user_id\", \"event_time\", \"field_name\", \"old_value\", \"new_value\",\r\n409:         ),\r\n410:         \"system_activity\": (\r\n411:             \"activity_id\", \"event_time\", \"event_type\", \"source_system\",\r\n412:             \"target_system\", \"resource_id\"